Z||000005||AkursedX||12-04-2001||11:18 AM||||Hehe, this reminds me of one of the strangest things that I have ever seen.  <P>Within a one month period, my best friend had hit 2 deer and he had a deer run right into the side of his car, and on each day he got hit by a deer, I locked my keys in my car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> .  It was really freaky, to me at least.<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||FieroKyleatSchool||12-04-2001||02:10 PM||||I don't have comprehensive on the car, bare minimum insurance.<P>Honking the horn works fine, but they were running in front of my car from the side. Going 55, 60 doesn't give ya enough time to honk your horn or think about it rather than to stop.||||reg||1
