Z||000008||JSocha||12-04-2001||05:46 PM||||That's nothing:<P>My dad was heading back up to his home at the lake in the evening in November of 1999.<P>Got 8 miles north of Willow City and hit 4 deer in his brand new 2000 Cadillac DeVille.  $13K+ worth of damage.<P>Our cats ate well that winter cause the wife and I went a couple of days later and picked em up and threw em into the back of the truck and then brought them back and threw them in the barn.  They were spread all over in the ditch.<P>Anyways, a week or so later, mom and dad were coming from their home at the lake to Rugby, and my father looked in the drivers side mirror of his Chevy Tahoe to see 6 or 7 deer coming out of the ditch and heading right at him.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> <P>So he pulled over to the side of the road and the 3 largest of them hit the rear drivers side of the Tahoe ($8K+ worth of damage to the Tahoe).<P>My mother was riding passenger  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> (And we all know what happens when wife's ride shotgun...errr...I mean passenger). <P>She started yelling at my father to watch where he was going.  My father was like  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">, I was...I even pulled over to the side because they were after me!<P>Must of been Kamakazi cousins to the four he killed.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000009||yo_sweet||12-04-2001||11:26 PM||||road trip schene  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>tommy : i don't see the loction on the map Richard!<P>Richard: ok well moron's here "while pointing at tommy's face" heh , so acncorton has to be..... <P>Tommy : stttttoooooppppppp deeeerrrr<P>richard: ahahahah errrrrrrrrrrrr<P>tommy: is he dead?<BR>richard: i don't know ive never seen one close up before...<P>tommy: poor little furry thing<BR>richard: i can't belive we hit him<BR>tommy: well maybe if you didn't lean over to insult me you would have seen it comming.<P>richard : shut up tommy it's not my fault<BR> <BR>they put the der int he back seat of the GTX<BR>it wakes up they scream and pull the car to a hault ahahahahaha i think it tryed to bite me!!<P>the deer runs off into the woods...<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>1986 Fiero SE 2.8lv6<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dance.gif">  <P><BR>www.geocities.com/acme_s2000/intro.html<BR>yo_sweet!||||reg||1
